us/2009354385349095672","line":759},{"title":"\n\n\"It is one of the most delightful thing (app, agent, product) I've used in a few years.\"\n\n@coyotevn","target":"https://x.com/coyotevn/status/2010270055985295529","line":763},{"title":"\n\n\"I'm literally building a whole website on a Nokia 3310 by calling @openclaw right now.\"\n\n@youbiak","target":"https://x.com/youbiak/status/2010097771735585016","line":767},{"title":"\n\n\"we live in truly wild times this post is sponsored by OpenClaw (not really but dang)\"\n\n@robinebers","target":"https://x.com/robinebers/status/2010713137277002207","line":771},{"title":"\n\n\"normies agi = OpenClaw + non-technical onboarding + hardware / iphone action button\"\n\n@sughanthans1","target":"https://x.com/sughanthans1/status/2012099108794982777","line":775},{"title":"\n\n\"gg man! everyday I speak to more people about OpenClaw and it never fails to amaze!\"\n\n@tomosman","target":"https://x.com/tomosman/status/2012661550692102382","line":779},{"title":"\n\n\"Essentially - you can automate almost anything you can do on the machine it sits on\"\n\n@aus\\_bytes","target":"https://x.com/aus_bytes/status/2010463830049161441","line":783},{"title":"\n\n\"Came out of my shell and gave my @openclaw, Shelly, my credit card. Works amazing.\"\n\n@jameskraus","target":"https://x.com/jameskraus/status/2012335532940894306","line":787},{"title":"\n\n\"Running fully locally off MiniMax 2.5 and can do the tool parsing for what I need!\"\n\n@TheZachMueller","target":"https://x.com/TheZachMueller/status/2012668844842578213","line":791},{"title":"\n\n\"Now that we have @openclaw I don’t really care which models will power Siri 🦞😄\"\n\n@deepstereo\\_","target":"https://x.com/deepstereo_/status/2010810551656726835","line":795},{"title":"\n\n\"Catching fun vibes I haven't felt since I first got into computers 30 years ago.\"\n\n@buddyhadry","target":"https://x.com/buddyhadry/status/2010005331925954739","line":799},{"title":"\n\n\"I was building my own, then found out @openclaw has most of the thing I need 👍\"\n\n@srg\\_io","target":"https://x.com/srg_io/status/2011976784355738029","line":803},{"title":"\n\n\"looks dope as an AI assistant love it's platform/os agnostic, trying right away\"\n\n@SaidAitmbarek","target":"https://x.com/SaidAitmbarek/status/2010467696828453178","line":807},{"title":"\n\n\"Added JMAP search to my OpenClaw. Along with 20 other things. From my phone.\"\n\n@jokull","target":"https://x.com/jokull/status/2011140610120642899","line":811},{"title":"\n\n\"@openclaw is so fun to play around with. The future of agents will be so fun\"\n\n@tyler6204","target":"https://x.com/tyler6204/status/2010887971743092744","line":815},{"title":"\n\n\"No more need to pay a virtual assistant!! @openclaw is about to take over!!\"\n\n@LinkScopic","target":"https://x.com/LinkScopic/status/2010896453808328933","line":819},{"title":"\n\n\"I got my girlfriend on board earlier today and she's seems hooked already\"\n\n@jandragsbaek","target":"https://x.com/jandragsbaek/status/2011581054206034300","line":823},{"title":"\n\n\"This is the best 'morning briefing' style interface I've seen, love it!\"\n\n@aaronmakelky","target":"https://x.com/aaronmakelky/status/2010190236584947845","line":827},{"title":"\n\n\"Can't believe I'm about to bootstrap Aineko from a lobster @openclaw\"\n\n@pilkster","target":"https://x.com/pilkster/status/2010150836857679878","line":831},{"title":"\n\n\"Everything Siri was supposed to be. And it goes so much further.\"\n\n@crossiBuilds","target":"https://x.com/crossiBuilds/status/2008478023826153665","line":835},{"title":"\n\n\"@openclaw might actually organise my life. unreal, just unreal.\"\n\n@Ashwinreads","target":"https://x.com/Ashwinreads/status/2010498194623311921","line":839},{"title":"\n\n\"What @steipete has built with @openclaw is out of this world.\"\n\n@KrauseFx","target":"https://x.com/KrauseFx/status/2008531076487246176","line":843},{"title":"\n\n\"Nano banana and RSS parsing set up in my @openclaw assistant\"\n\n@rafadc","target":"https://x.com/rafadc/status/2010498529106530814","line":847},{"title":"\n\n\"A glimpse into the future of how normal people will use AI.\"\n\n@tysonhutchins\\_","target":"https://x.com/tysonhutchins_/status/2010046933893865701","line":851},{"title":"\n\n\"I just tried @openclaw using telegram. Wow. This is crazy.\"\n\n@JorgeMenaDev","target":"https://x.com/JorgeMenaDev/status/2012512348456599719","line":855},{"title":"\n\n\"What you've given to the world is nothing short of amazing\"\n\n@BitcoinPeace77","target":"https://x.com/BitcoinPeace77/status/2013064560992047412","line":859},{"title":"\n\n\"What a cool thing to have AI on call at your own computer.\"\n\n@\\_KevinTang","target":"https://x.com/_KevinTang/status/2010914035550634494","line":863},{"title":"\n\n\"Excellent reading thank you. Love oracle and Claw.\"\n\n@karpathy","target":"https://x.com/karpathy/status/2005692186470514904","line":867},{"title":"\n\n\"Lol, this is hilarious, troubling, and awesome\"\n\n@mike\\_kasberg","target":"https://x.com/mike_kasberg/status/2012314819819348259","line":871},{"title":"\n\n\"Thanks for making OpenClaw @steipete, Big fan.\"\n\n@adityac7896","target":"https://x.com/adityac7896/status/2010405545606631719","line":875},{"title":"\n\n\"just use @openclaw man, it will set you free.\"\n\n@serrrfirat","target":"https://x.com/serrrfirat/status/2011128261196333448","line":879},{"title":"\n\n\"2026 is already the year of personal agents.\"\n\n@chrisdietr","target":"https://x.com/chrisdietr/status/2010555854613803198","line":883},{"title":"\n\n\"Try @openclaw if you want more powerful 😆\"\n\n@bangnokia","target":"https://x.com/bangnokia/status/2010914976308060301","line":887},{"title":"\n\n\"This lobster is gonna take over the world\"\n\n@alex\\_here\\_now","target":"https://x.com/alex_here_now/status/2010473539514904746","line":891},{"title":"\n\n\"This is nuts. @openclaw is a superpower.\"\n\n@robmartinson","target":"https://x.com/robmartinson/status/2010410971056242689","line":895},{"title":"\n\n\"@openclaw is Jarvis. It already exists.\"\n\n@nofil\\_ai","target":"https://x.com/nofil_ai/status/2010460892576788958","line":899},{"title":"\n\n\"updates from @openclaw absolutely rule\"\n\n@theysayheygreg","target":"https://x.com/theysayheygreg/status/2010867523713945666","line":903},{"title":"\n\n\"@openclaw is what you are looking for.\"\n\n@zachknicker","target":"https://x.com/zachknicker/status/2010172821495001180","line":907},{"title":"\n\n\"TLDR; open source built a better version of Siri that Apple ($3.6 trillion company) was sleeping on for years. Welcome to the AI era where a dude and a repo fills in the cracks of billion dollar industries.\"\n\n@Hesamation","target":"https://x.com/Hesamation/status/2015110922159730971","line":911},{"title":"\n\n\"The future is now old man: @openclaw!\"\n\n@Fhaefi","target":"https://x.com/Fhaefi/status/2012120124229402916","line":915},{"title":"\n\n\"AGI is a lobster, it will never sink!\"\n\n@FrancisBrero","target":"https://x.com/FrancisBrero/status/2012317589117247782","line":919},{"title":"\n\n\"Feels like we're living in the future\"\n\n@Philo01","target":"https://x.com/Philo01/status/2011214857614606435","line":923},{"title":"Runs on Your Machine","target":"https://docs.openclaw.ai/getting-started","line":937},{"title":"Any Chat App","target":"https://openclaw.ai/integrations","line":941},{"title":"Persistent Memory","target":"https://docs.openclaw.ai/session","line":945},{"title":"Browser Control","target":"https://docs.openclaw.ai/browser","line":949},{"title":"Full System Access","target":"https://docs.openclaw.ai/bash","line":953},{"title":"Skills & Plugins","target":"https://docs.openclaw.ai/skills","line":957},{"title":"15+ Agent Army Running Across 3 Machines","target":"https://x.com/jdrhyne/status/2012778049406742632","line":965},{"title":"Personal Operating System With Daily Briefings","target":"https://x.com/danpeguine/status/2012565160586625345","line":971},{"title":"Voice-Guided Production Fix While Walking the Dog","target":"https://x.com/georgedagg_/status/2012119327147798753","line":977},{"title":"One Chat Controlling Mail, Messages, Orders, Calls, and a Vault","target":"https://x.com/dreetje/status/2012535486401671588","line":983},{"title":"OpenClaw’s AI assistants are now building their own social network","target":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/01/30/openclaws-ai-assistants-are-now-building-their-own-social-network/","line":991},{"title":"OpenClaw creator Peter Steinberger joins OpenAI","target":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/02/15/openclaw-creator-peter-steinberger-joins-openai/","line":999},{"title":"The OpenClaw superfan meetup serves optimism and lobster","target":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/890517/openclaw-clawcon-meetup-nyc-open-source-ai","line":1007},{"title":"OpenClaw creator Peter Steinberger joins OpenAI","target":"https://www.theverge.com/openai/630450/peter-steinberger-openclaw-openai","line":1015}],"metadata":{"title":"OpenClaw — Personal AI Assistant","source":"https://openclaw.ai/","author":null,"published":null,"created":"2026-04-28","description":"OpenClaw — The AI that actually does things. Your personal assistant on any platform.","date created":"Tuesday, April 28th 2026, 6:26:31 pm","date modified":"Tuesday, April 28th 2026, 6:26:42 pm"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"- OpenClaw — Personal AI Assistant.md"},
