assistant\"\n\n@rafadc","target":"https://x.com/rafadc/status/2010498529106530814","line":836},{"title":"\n\n\"A glimpse into the future of how normal people will use AI.\"\n\n@tysonhutchins\\_","target":"https://x.com/tysonhutchins_/status/2010046933893865701","line":840},{"title":"\n\n\"I just tried @openclaw using telegram. Wow. This is crazy.\"\n\n@JorgeMenaDev","target":"https://x.com/JorgeMenaDev/status/2012512348456599719","line":844},{"title":"\n\n\"What you've given to the world is nothing short of amazing\"\n\n@BitcoinPeace77","target":"https://x.com/BitcoinPeace77/status/2013064560992047412","line":848},{"title":"\n\n\"What a cool thing to have AI on call at your own computer.\"\n\n@\\_KevinTang","target":"https://x.com/_KevinTang/status/2010914035550634494","line":852},{"title":"\n\n\"Excellent reading thank you. Love oracle and Claw.\"\n\n@karpathy","target":"https://x.com/karpathy/status/2005692186470514904","line":856},{"title":"\n\n\"Lol, this is hilarious, troubling, and awesome\"\n\n@mike\\_kasberg","target":"https://x.com/mike_kasberg/status/2012314819819348259","line":860},{"title":"\n\n\"Thanks for making OpenClaw @steipete, Big fan.\"\n\n@adityac7896","target":"https://x.com/adityac7896/status/2010405545606631719","line":864},{"title":"\n\n\"just use @openclaw man, it will set you free.\"\n\n@serrrfirat","target":"https://x.com/serrrfirat/status/2011128261196333448","line":868},{"title":"\n\n\"2026 is already the year of personal agents.\"\n\n@chrisdietr","target":"https://x.com/chrisdietr/status/2010555854613803198","line":872},{"title":"\n\n\"Try @openclaw if you want more powerful 😆\"\n\n@bangnokia","target":"https://x.com/bangnokia/status/2010914976308060301","line":876},{"title":"\n\n\"This lobster is gonna take over the world\"\n\n@alex\\_here\\_now","target":"https://x.com/alex_here_now/status/2010473539514904746","line":880},{"title":"\n\n\"This is nuts. @openclaw is a superpower.\"\n\n@robmartinson","target":"https://x.com/robmartinson/status/2010410971056242689","line":884},{"title":"\n\n\"@openclaw is Jarvis. It already exists.\"\n\n@nofil\\_ai","target":"https://x.com/nofil_ai/status/2010460892576788958","line":888},{"title":"\n\n\"updates from @openclaw absolutely rule\"\n\n@theysayheygreg","target":"https://x.com/theysayheygreg/status/2010867523713945666","line":892},{"title":"\n\n\"@openclaw is what you are looking for.\"\n\n@zachknicker","target":"https://x.com/zachknicker/status/2010172821495001180","line":896},{"title":"\n\n\"TLDR; open source built a better version of Siri that Apple ($3.6 trillion company) was sleeping on for years. Welcome to the AI era where a dude and a repo fills in the cracks of billion dollar industries.\"\n\n@Hesamation","target":"https://x.com/Hesamation/status/2015110922159730971","line":900},{"title":"\n\n\"The future is now old man: @openclaw!\"\n\n@Fhaefi","target":"https://x.com/Fhaefi/status/2012120124229402916","line":904},{"title":"\n\n\"AGI is a lobster, it will never sink!\"\n\n@FrancisBrero","target":"https://x.com/FrancisBrero/status/2012317589117247782","line":908},{"title":"\n\n\"Feels like we're living in the future\"\n\n@Philo01","target":"https://x.com/Philo01/status/2011214857614606435","line":912}],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"i18kf3","at":1779498923087}},
